WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:01:00.000 --> 00:01:00.522
Hey.

00:01:02.796 --> 00:01:03.898
We meet again.

00:01:05.664 --> 00:01:06.744
Have a seat.

00:01:12.491 --> 00:01:15.985
Did you just get here, 
or have you already finished your meal?

00:01:17.021 --> 00:01:18.423
Are you here alone?

00:01:19.337 --> 00:01:20.413
You can sit with me.

00:01:22.951 --> 00:01:24.234
I finished my meal.

00:01:24.945 --> 00:01:25.874
I’m about to leave.

00:01:26.849 --> 00:01:32.065
I think we will run into each other often.

00:01:37.812 --> 00:01:39.186
You don’t seem to enjoy your meal.

00:01:44.524 --> 00:01:45.776
The dish is delicious.

00:01:48.111 --> 00:01:49.244
I just feel a bit down.

00:01:49.894 --> 00:01:50.870
So I don’t want to eat it.

00:01:54.647 --> 00:01:56.661
Is something bothering you?

00:02:02.204 --> 00:02:05.325
I met someone.

00:02:09.163 --> 00:02:10.306
Don’t tell me

00:02:11.017 --> 00:02:12.211
a pretty girl like you

00:02:13.348 --> 00:02:14.361
is also going through a breakup?

00:02:16.594 --> 00:02:18.442
I can’t even call it a breakup.

00:02:19.518 --> 00:02:20.710
It’s just a one-night stand.

00:02:22.070 --> 00:02:23.715
Then you don’t need to care about it.

00:02:24.324 --> 00:02:25.701
There are many girls out there.

00:02:28.341 --> 00:02:29.855
But she…

00:02:32.677 --> 00:02:34.427
She is different from other girls.

00:02:38.529 --> 00:02:42.615
So this one night,

00:02:44.300 --> 00:02:45.484
it must be really good.

00:02:53.281 --> 00:02:54.140
Okay.

00:02:55.176 --> 00:02:57.631
Now I get why you feel down.

00:02:58.991 --> 00:03:01.096
I don’t want to end just one night.

00:03:08.691 --> 00:03:12.646
Theoretically, if you think it was a great night,

00:03:13.560 --> 00:03:15.475
she probably feels the same.

00:03:21.628 --> 00:03:23.287
If you were me,

00:03:25.318 --> 00:03:26.501
what would you do?

00:03:31.131 --> 00:03:32.629
If I were you,

00:03:36.000 --> 00:03:37.546
I would…

00:03:40.693 --> 00:03:41.770
make a move on her.

00:03:44.349 --> 00:03:45.748
If she was that tasty,

00:03:46.398 --> 00:03:47.820
I couldn’t let it end after just one night.

00:03:48.165 --> 00:03:48.817
Am I right?

00:03:52.127 --> 00:03:52.949
Yes.

00:03:54.289 --> 00:03:55.040
Good idea.

00:03:59.266 --> 00:04:00.828
We’ve been talking for a while.

00:04:01.457 --> 00:04:02.816
I still don’t know your name.

00:04:07.243 --> 00:04:08.298
What’s your name?

00:04:13.325 --> 00:04:14.551
Does it matter?

00:04:16.764 --> 00:04:18.812
What if we run into each other often?

00:04:19.401 --> 00:04:20.696
Don’t we need to know each other’s names?

00:04:22.280 --> 00:04:23.685
This way our relationship will be unique.

00:04:27.360 --> 00:04:28.046
Good.

00:04:28.838 --> 00:04:30.898
It’s fun. I like it.

00:04:34.594 --> 00:04:36.691
Okay, deal.

00:04:37.503 --> 00:04:38.788
We had a good talk today.

00:04:38.788 --> 00:04:39.916
I hope to see you again.

00:04:42.881 --> 00:04:44.883
Do you want to go grab a drink with me?

00:04:45.147 --> 00:04:46.236
Sorry.

00:04:46.784 --> 00:04:47.962
I already have a plan.

00:04:48.246 --> 00:04:49.525
I’m meeting with my family.

00:04:51.576 --> 00:04:52.777
Good night.

00:04:53.894 --> 00:04:54.633
Good night.

00:05:02.812 --> 00:05:03.504
Bye.

00:05:19.105 --> 00:05:20.199
Do you want anything else?

00:05:22.453 --> 00:05:23.790
I have another one of these.

00:05:31.500 --> 00:05:32.523
Hello, Miss Chan.

00:05:33.518 --> 00:05:34.636
Is everything alright?

00:05:34.636 --> 00:05:35.136
Yes.

00:05:35.867 --> 00:05:36.917
Do you want your usual?

00:05:43.171 --> 00:05:44.443
We meet again.

00:05:49.023 --> 00:05:49.743
You.

00:05:51.043 --> 00:05:52.132
What are you doing here?

00:05:53.452 --> 00:05:54.827
I work here.

00:05:56.959 --> 00:05:58.567
I work here as a singer.

00:06:01.085 --> 00:06:02.033
That’s right.

00:06:08.242 --> 00:06:09.539
I told you.

00:06:10.514 --> 00:06:12.493
We would meet again.

00:06:14.199 --> 00:06:15.992
Because I work at your bar.

00:06:19.383 --> 00:06:20.667
Why aren’t you working today?

00:06:22.921 --> 00:06:24.003
Today is my day off.

00:06:26.338 --> 00:06:30.339
But actually, I want to have a side job.

00:06:31.842 --> 00:06:33.648
Do you have another job for me?

00:06:35.049 --> 00:06:40.175
Especially a job where I can be close to you.

00:06:47.505 --> 00:06:49.106
People who work closely with me

00:06:50.426 --> 00:06:51.519
must be good at their job.

00:06:52.717 --> 00:06:53.934
Exceptionally good.

00:06:59.571 --> 00:07:01.447
Wasn’t I good the other night?

00:07:04.046 --> 00:07:04.976
What are you talking about?

00:07:05.321 --> 00:07:06.142
So naughty.

00:07:16.471 --> 00:07:17.144
Chan.

00:07:20.576 --> 00:07:21.581
Is this your new friend?

00:07:26.353 --> 00:07:27.546
She’s just a silly kid.

00:07:28.054 --> 00:07:28.978
Don’t pay attention to her.

00:07:42.604 --> 00:07:44.474
I upset the pretty sis.

00:08:08.012 --> 00:08:09.179
Are you here alone?

00:08:11.717 --> 00:08:12.457
Yes.

00:08:16.741 --> 00:08:18.498
Your cocktail looks tasty.

00:08:20.793 --> 00:08:21.773
What is the name?

00:08:23.235 --> 00:08:25.091
You mean the name of the cocktail?

00:08:26.797 --> 00:08:27.980
Or my name?

00:08:28.772 --> 00:08:30.108
Both.

00:08:32.829 --> 00:08:34.750
But I want to know your name more.

00:08:43.277 --> 00:08:44.531
Do you want to taste it?

00:08:51.889 --> 00:08:53.092
It tastes good.

00:08:53.896 --> 00:08:55.563
It tastes good. That should be enough.

00:08:57.594 --> 00:08:58.944
You don’t need to know the name.

00:09:22.358 --> 00:09:23.799
You are so pretty.

00:09:24.672 --> 00:09:26.057
Do you really not have a girlfriend?

00:09:26.869 --> 00:09:28.414
I don’t like commitment.

00:09:29.470 --> 00:09:30.501
Me too.

00:09:41.835 --> 00:09:42.539
Hey.

00:09:43.696 --> 00:09:46.189
If you’re going to do that, 
can you do it somewhere else?

00:09:48.260 --> 00:09:49.546
The upper floors are a hotel.

00:09:50.013 --> 00:09:50.940
It has rooms available.

00:09:55.529 --> 00:09:56.444
Let’s go.

00:09:57.683 --> 00:09:58.895
You should leave.

00:09:59.139 --> 00:10:00.133
I’ll see you later.

00:10:00.133 --> 00:10:00.846
What?

00:10:00.988 --> 00:10:01.807
Are you serious?

00:10:03.533 --> 00:10:04.430
Yes.

00:10:04.978 --> 00:10:06.409
I don’t want to go with you anymore.

00:10:06.957 --> 00:10:07.910
Damn it.

00:10:16.779 --> 00:10:18.250
Why did you get in the car?

00:10:18.514 --> 00:10:20.512
I have an offer for you, pretty sis.

00:10:21.649 --> 00:10:22.562
What is it?

00:10:22.562 --> 00:10:24.058
I want to be your sugar baby.

00:10:24.972 --> 00:10:26.595
I want you to adore me.

00:10:29.336 --> 00:10:30.639
I’m good at pampering.

00:10:31.614 --> 00:10:32.598
Please take me.

00:10:33.552 --> 00:10:34.965
What the hell are you saying?

00:10:37.036 --> 00:10:38.018
What are you doing?

00:10:38.993 --> 00:10:40.329
The other night.

00:10:41.832 --> 00:10:45.546
When the light went off, you stopped talking.

00:10:46.257 --> 00:10:47.766
I thought…

00:10:49.736 --> 00:10:50.994
you may prefer it when it’s dark.

00:11:37.489 --> 00:11:38.839
You still haven’t told me

00:11:40.342 --> 00:11:42.102
why you got the moon tattoo.

00:12:12.596 --> 00:12:14.022
Why are you crying?

00:12:25.676 --> 00:12:26.707
I think…

00:12:27.743 --> 00:12:28.990
I should go.

00:12:30.513 --> 00:12:31.691
I’ll see you.

00:13:00.151 --> 00:13:02.098
Did you intentionally hit my car?

00:13:02.179 --> 00:13:02.953
No way.

00:13:02.953 --> 00:13:04.454
Why would I do that?

00:13:04.454 --> 00:13:06.435
You always try to get my attention.

